WEBVTT

01:36.840 --> 01:39.993
[Episode 2]

02:10.780 --> 02:12.180
You should leave now.

02:12.180 --> 02:13.780
Run far away.

02:14.547 --> 02:18.260
The people from Hanshui Palace
weren't badly hurt.

02:18.260 --> 02:20.500
They might come back for you.

02:21.413 --> 02:22.946
I can't guarantee to protect you.

02:22.946 --> 02:26.120
If you stay with me, you won't be safe.

02:27.147 --> 02:30.240
When did Yan Zi Qing become so useless?

02:31.813 --> 02:33.380
You're hurt?

02:34.380 --> 02:36.380
I blame myself for being too weak.

02:36.380 --> 02:37.547
Let me help.

02:38.547 --> 02:40.980
Are the Hanshui Palace people that powerful?

02:41.980 --> 02:44.680
I've kept them here for you.

02:45.413 --> 02:47.813
Come here,
you didn't drink that poison, did you?

02:48.613 --> 02:49.913
That's a relief.

02:51.013 --> 02:52.380
It's getting dark.

02:52.380 --> 02:54.247
Get him down the mountain quickly.

02:54.247 --> 02:55.520
What about you?

02:56.380 --> 02:58.813
Have you forgotten? We're not on the same path.

02:58.813 --> 03:00.980
But we just agreed that we're even.

03:00.980 --> 03:02.360
I helped you lose Yan Zi Qing.

03:02.360 --> 03:04.613
You drove off Hanshui Palace for me
and saved the child.

03:04.613 --> 03:07.020
Actually, I'm the one who owes you a favor.

03:08.413 --> 03:12.780
Does Linglong Manor always calculate favors
in such a unique way?

03:12.780 --> 03:15.680
Anyway, I don't like owing people.

03:18.647 --> 03:20.247
They're coming from the east.

03:20.247 --> 03:22.040
Let's head down the mountain and hide first.

03:22.040 --> 03:23.420
What if we run into them on the way?

03:23.420 --> 03:26.460
The drums mean they make the pursuers
head up from the east.

03:26.460 --> 03:28.247
Then we'll head down from the west.

03:28.247 --> 03:29.753
You can understand drums?

03:29.753 --> 03:32.660
The training routines of government troops
are all quite similar.

03:32.660 --> 03:34.832
I only know some basics.

03:34.832 --> 03:37.319
Did you offend the government, too?

03:43.820 --> 03:45.340
We won't make it off the mountain before dark.

03:45.340 --> 03:46.700
Let's find a place to hide first.

03:46.700 --> 03:48.759
Let's go.

04:15.247 --> 04:17.446
What is this being worshipped here?

04:17.446 --> 04:19.213
It's quite terrifying.

04:21.980 --> 04:23.613
It's a Yaksha.

04:28.313 --> 04:30.847
There was one behind the counter
at the inn as well.

04:31.446 --> 04:32.713
How strange.

04:32.713 --> 04:34.313
Why would anyone worship a demon?

04:34.313 --> 04:38.147
In this Xiangzhou area,
many people worship the Yaksha.

04:40.113 --> 04:42.313
It must be a local custom.

04:47.580 --> 04:49.780
Linglong Manor is in Xiangzhou.

04:49.780 --> 04:51.596
Haven't you seen this before, Huo?

04:51.596 --> 04:53.140
I usually stay inside the manor.

04:53.140 --> 04:55.760
I know very little of the world outside.

04:58.860 --> 05:00.180
No wonder.

05:00.180 --> 05:02.960
The innkeeper said I looked like an outsider.

05:55.700 --> 05:59.100
Is your back wound really alright?

05:59.100 --> 06:00.594
I'm fine.

06:00.594 --> 06:03.149
It's just a flesh wound.

06:12.700 --> 06:15.332
This is our Linglong Manor's
secret Linglong Honey.

06:15.332 --> 06:18.098
It stops bleeding and eases pain.

06:18.098 --> 06:20.243
Thank you, Huo.

06:32.540 --> 06:33.590
So, tell me.

06:33.590 --> 06:36.779
How did you cross paths with
Yan Zi Qing and his lot?

06:37.580 --> 06:39.460
Just some grievance.

06:39.460 --> 06:41.424
It's nothing major.

06:42.424 --> 06:47.041
Actually, Linglong Manor and Yunying Sect
have a bit of a history together.

06:47.041 --> 06:48.780
Why don't you tell me the details?

06:48.780 --> 06:51.843
Let me see if I can help smooth things over.

06:55.787 --> 06:57.500
What are you laughing at?

06:57.500 --> 07:00.120
Do you think I can't handle it?

07:01.420 --> 07:05.780
I simply don't think
you can return to your manor.

07:05.780 --> 07:07.146
What do you mean?

07:07.146 --> 07:11.380
You said, "No one dares to provoke
Linglong Manor in Xiangzhou."

07:11.380 --> 07:15.446
Yet you'd rather flee with a child
than go back home for help.

07:15.446 --> 07:19.325
Isn't it because you caused trouble
and can't go back anymore?

07:19.325 --> 07:21.672
Who says I can't go back?

07:21.672 --> 07:24.460
I just don't want to.

07:25.460 --> 07:28.547
The Yin Yang An is the treasure
of Linglong Manor.

07:28.547 --> 07:32.256
It is said that it stays in the Huo family hall
and has never left.

07:32.256 --> 07:34.900
Now, this sword is in your hands.

07:34.900 --> 07:37.713
And you don't even have anyone to protect you.

07:37.713 --> 07:39.780
I assume when you left the manor,

07:39.780 --> 07:43.120
Master Huo wasn't aware of it, right?

07:47.946 --> 07:50.946
Fine. You guessed it.

07:50.946 --> 07:53.380
But I didn't cause any trouble.

07:53.380 --> 07:57.680
I just ruined the marriage between
the Huo family and Shao Ji Zu.

07:57.680 --> 07:59.213
Why did you do that?

07:59.213 --> 08:02.660
Because our young mistress won't marry
someone she doesn't like.

08:04.780 --> 08:07.847
Everyone says, "Shao Ji Zu is quite good."

08:07.847 --> 08:09.340
But so what if he's good?

08:09.340 --> 08:11.147
Does she have to marry him for that?

08:11.913 --> 08:13.380
Speaking of being good,

08:13.380 --> 08:15.113
our young mistress is good too.

08:15.113 --> 08:17.380
She's been educated in arts and martial arts.

08:18.580 --> 08:23.963
It's just that she has never seen the world
outside of Linglong Manor.

08:26.547 --> 08:28.913
Even if she is to marry,

08:28.913 --> 08:32.860
she must first go out and see the world
and gain some experience.

08:32.860 --> 08:36.643
Then she can judge for herself
if he is truly a good man.

08:39.713 --> 08:41.380
That makes sense.

08:41.380 --> 08:45.613
However, to see Shao Ji Zu for who he is,

08:45.613 --> 08:48.947
you don't need to go out of your way
to wander the world.

08:48.947 --> 08:51.013
I saw through him long ago.

08:51.013 --> 08:56.100
That man has an unspeakable hypocrisy,
and he's arrogant.

08:56.100 --> 09:00.913
He always says our young mistress is highly
skilled in martial arts and a natural prodigy.

09:00.913 --> 09:03.780
He even says,
"Given time, she will definitely defeat him."

09:03.780 --> 09:06.540
Setting aside whether he's sincere,

09:06.540 --> 09:10.316
just that phrase, "she will surely defeat him",
isn't that arrogant?

09:10.316 --> 09:12.156
Why use him as the standard?

09:12.156 --> 09:14.546
He's no great master.

09:14.546 --> 09:17.180
Your young mistress is quite good
at judging people.

09:17.180 --> 09:19.336
Of course.

09:22.436 --> 09:26.713
It's just a pity that she has never
actually defeated Shao Ji Zu even once.

09:26.713 --> 09:28.247
It's so frustrating.

09:28.247 --> 09:30.847
Martial arts is about perception.

09:30.847 --> 09:34.136
No one knows where a person's limit is.

09:37.780 --> 09:41.313
I didn't expect
that while being hunted by soldiers

09:41.313 --> 09:44.613
and carrying a child
who could bring trouble at any moment,

09:44.613 --> 09:46.313
you could still be this happy.

09:46.313 --> 09:48.380
I've only been out for a few days,

09:48.380 --> 09:52.390
but I've fought with Shengyun Stronghold
and the Tang Sect.

09:54.447 --> 09:58.936
Perhaps there will be
even more adventures ahead.

10:00.286 --> 10:01.646
When we reach the capital,

10:01.646 --> 10:03.876
I'll introduce you to a powerful backer,
Xiao Zhao.

10:03.876 --> 10:05.847
With him around, we have nothing to fear.

10:05.847 --> 10:08.913
Forget Shengyun Stronghold or Hanshui Palace.

10:08.913 --> 10:10.313
Even if the Heroes of the North
and South showed up,

10:10.313 --> 10:12.313
I wouldn't be afraid.

10:12.313 --> 10:13.947
Surnamed Zhao,

10:13.947 --> 10:15.780
and he's your backer.

10:15.780 --> 10:18.000
There's likely only one such person
in the capital.

10:18.000 --> 10:19.000
That's him.

10:19.000 --> 10:21.340
The Master of Nanqing Palace,
cousin to the current Emperor.

10:21.340 --> 10:22.820
Zhao Zhuo Qing.

10:23.813 --> 10:26.413
Huo, you are a friend of Prince Hui?

10:26.413 --> 10:28.500
You know him?

10:28.500 --> 10:31.947
Then do you also know
the young servant by his side, Zhao Zhi Er?

10:31.947 --> 10:36.413
The one who's known as The Terror of the Gods?

10:36.413 --> 10:38.413
Compared to The Terror of the Gods,

10:38.413 --> 10:42.247
I'm actually more familiar
with the one called The Ghost's Sorrow.

10:42.247 --> 10:46.020
Lord Zhan's servant, Ming Zhu Er?

10:46.020 --> 10:48.113
I heard that the two of them
are a pair of mischievous monkeys.

10:48.113 --> 10:52.013
The children in the capital have even turned
their exploits into nursery rhymes.

10:52.013 --> 10:53.613
Were you also teased by them?

10:53.613 --> 10:55.447
Not teased, exactly.

10:55.447 --> 11:00.550
But they certainly caused me
a great deal of trouble.

11:02.613 --> 11:04.980
You've been fishing for info from me,

11:04.980 --> 11:08.186
but now I've finally spotted your slip-up.

11:09.240 --> 11:12.100
You must be someone from the court.

11:12.100 --> 11:15.680
Otherwise,
you wouldn't know so many inside details.

11:15.680 --> 11:18.113
Are you sure the person you met
was his accomplice?

11:18.113 --> 11:20.650
Most likely.
The man had excellent lightness skills.

11:20.650 --> 11:22.880
He led me in circles through
the woods for quite a long time.

11:22.880 --> 11:26.213
After that,
I completely lost track of his trail.

11:26.213 --> 11:27.447
Strange.

11:27.447 --> 11:30.670
I've never heard of him
having an accomplice before.

11:34.580 --> 11:36.920
[Yan Ziqing, Yunying Sect]
[Mo Dao, Master of The Xiuluo Cult]

11:36.920 --> 11:41.320
There are too many fallen leaves at this time.

11:50.640 --> 11:53.960
It's Hanshui Palace's Dragon-Slaying Coil.

11:53.960 --> 11:56.747
The one fighting here shouldn't be him.

11:56.747 --> 11:58.713
He was hit
by your Old Souls at First Glance poison.

11:58.713 --> 12:01.780
So he wouldn't be foolish enough
to cross Hanshui Palace again.

12:01.780 --> 12:05.380
No. It must be him.

12:05.380 --> 12:10.780
In this world, how many people are there
who can withstand the Dragon-Slaying Coil?

12:10.780 --> 12:13.847
We must capture him before Shao Ji Zu does.

12:13.847 --> 12:18.740
Such a massive achievement
cannot be allowed to slip away.

12:20.450 --> 12:22.060
He is so severely injured,

12:22.060 --> 12:24.900
yet he took a direct hit from the Sun Envoy.

12:24.900 --> 12:28.980
The two of us are no match for him.

12:29.980 --> 12:33.513
Do you know why your Yunying Sect
can never achieve greatness?

12:33.513 --> 12:35.180
Too many damn rules.

12:35.180 --> 12:38.046
Who says capturing someone
requires a head-on confrontation? Stupid.

12:38.046 --> 12:41.847
Our Xiuluo Cult roam the world
relying on more than just martial arts.

12:41.847 --> 12:43.700
If we want to catch him,

12:43.700 --> 12:45.913
there are plenty of ways.

12:45.913 --> 12:48.146
What? Giving up the search?

12:48.146 --> 12:49.313
Search for what?

12:49.313 --> 12:50.713
If he wants to leave Xiangzhou,

12:50.713 --> 12:52.180
he must travel by water.

12:52.180 --> 12:53.980
Then we'll wait for him at the ferry.

12:53.980 --> 12:56.613
Waiting at our ease for a weary enemy
is much easier than

12:56.613 --> 12:59.480
exhausting ourselves chasing him
through these mountains, right?

13:21.113 --> 13:24.399
I wonder who could be so cruel.

13:25.980 --> 13:27.780
Huo.

13:27.780 --> 13:30.413
This child must be from the Hanshui Palace.

13:31.320 --> 13:32.913
When you lured Yan Zi Qing away,

13:32.913 --> 13:37.247
the Sun Envoy mentioned he hadn't had
his medicine for days.

13:37.247 --> 13:40.530
It seems he's been fed poison since childhood.

13:40.530 --> 13:42.900
Fed poison since childhood?

13:45.980 --> 13:49.220
He's been fed poison since childhood,
yet he's perfectly fine now.

13:50.013 --> 13:52.196
Do you mean

13:52.196 --> 13:55.020
he's like those from the Xiuluo Cult
or the Tang Sect,

13:55.020 --> 13:57.420
taking poison to train?

13:57.420 --> 13:59.340
But looking at his meridians,

13:59.340 --> 14:00.996
he doesn't look like a martial artist.

14:00.996 --> 14:03.146
Do you remember Ge Yun Fei?

14:03.146 --> 14:04.860
He didn't want to kill the boy.

14:04.860 --> 14:06.913
He wanted to use him to save a life.

14:06.913 --> 14:08.380
To save a life?

14:08.380 --> 14:14.140
You must have heard of the secret treasure
of Hanshui Palace, the Chang Hong Bi.

14:14.140 --> 14:17.300
The century-old Hanshui Palace
possesses the rare Chang Hong Bi,

14:17.300 --> 14:19.180
[Chang Hong Bi, Hanshui Palace]
nurtured with Azure Tri-Life Water.

14:19.180 --> 14:22.546
The value of this treasure is its ability
to cure all poisons.

14:22.546 --> 14:24.980
The treasure that Shengyun Stronghold
and the Tang Sect are fighting for

14:24.980 --> 14:28.980
is not an object, but this child.

14:28.980 --> 14:30.580
The Chang Hong Bi is not a piece of jade.

14:30.580 --> 14:32.780
It is a person?

14:32.780 --> 14:35.780
This child has so many scars on their hands.

14:35.780 --> 14:38.510
I'm afraid that's where they came from.

14:42.180 --> 14:43.436
No wonder.

14:43.436 --> 14:46.913
He always carries a faint scent of medicine.

14:46.913 --> 14:51.247
The green poison that the two envoys
of Hanshui Palace forced him to drink,

14:51.247 --> 14:53.847
I'm afraid it was Azure Tri-Life Water.

14:53.847 --> 14:55.313
Due to his unique constitution,

14:55.313 --> 14:57.413
he can drink it for years and survive.

14:57.413 --> 15:00.546
Though he survives,

15:00.546 --> 15:04.847
he still has to endure the immense pain
of the poison.

15:04.847 --> 15:07.870
Perhaps to Granny Hanshui,

15:09.046 --> 15:12.460
he is just an object kept by Hanshui Palace.

15:13.247 --> 15:17.713
But the legend of the Chang Hong Bi
has existed for over a hundred years.

15:17.713 --> 15:20.620
Could this child already be
a hundred years old?

15:20.620 --> 15:26.380
Don't the eldest daughters of Linglong Manor
all take the same name, Huo Ling Long?

15:26.380 --> 15:27.780
Over this past century,

15:27.780 --> 15:31.213
the Chang Hong Bi
may not always be the same person.

15:31.213 --> 15:35.046
So the claim that the Chang Hong Bi
is a jade is just a rumor

15:35.046 --> 15:38.713
spread by the Hanshui Palace
to mislead everyone.

15:38.713 --> 15:42.320
No wonder he eyes everyone
with such a weird look.

15:42.320 --> 15:45.546
Wandering the world at such a young age,

15:45.546 --> 15:48.780
with everyone coveting his special ability,

15:48.780 --> 15:53.336
it's no surprise that he doesn't trust anyone.

15:57.103 --> 16:01.460
I suspect he is more calculating
than you think.

16:01.460 --> 16:03.780
In the fight between Shengyun Stronghold
and the Tang Sect,

16:03.780 --> 16:08.213
that yellow dog pouncing out
suddenly must have been his doing.

16:08.213 --> 16:09.713
Do you remember?

16:09.713 --> 16:14.540
The dog was overly affectionate toward him
the first time they met.

16:14.540 --> 16:18.380
Are you saying he knows Mind Control?

16:18.380 --> 16:21.196
This skill must be practiced from childhood.

16:21.196 --> 16:22.380
Upon reaching a certain age,

16:22.380 --> 16:23.980
it must be aided by inner power.

16:23.980 --> 16:25.980
He has no inner power,

16:25.980 --> 16:28.947
so the Mind Control is beyond his reach.

16:28.947 --> 16:30.660
But to deal with a dog,

16:30.660 --> 16:32.940
it is more than enough.

16:32.940 --> 16:35.580
He was betting
that you would step in to save the dog,

16:35.580 --> 16:38.803
thereby changing the course of the battle.

16:40.380 --> 16:44.056
Do you still intend to continue protecting him?

16:51.253 --> 16:53.320
If our guesses are correct,

16:53.320 --> 16:56.300
he grew up in Hanshui Palace,

16:56.300 --> 16:59.780
forced to swallow poison every day
at the mercy of others,

16:59.780 --> 17:02.513
enduring endless agony.

17:02.513 --> 17:05.213
No one has ever treated him like a human being.

17:05.213 --> 17:08.413
So how could he know what compassion is?

17:08.413 --> 17:11.647
How could he distinguish
between right and wrong?

17:11.647 --> 17:14.003
He just wants to survive.

17:15.147 --> 17:18.513
You are truly broad-minded and kind-hearted.

17:19.413 --> 17:21.046
But in the martial arts world,

17:21.046 --> 17:22.780
with a personality like yours,

17:22.780 --> 17:24.340
I'm afraid you'll be taken advantage of.

17:24.340 --> 17:25.943
The world may be dangerous,

17:25.943 --> 17:28.616
but there are good people like you too.

17:29.940 --> 17:34.247
In my opinion,
why don't we just travel together?

17:34.247 --> 17:36.613
Traveling with me is not a good idea.

17:36.613 --> 17:37.967
Also--

17:38.620 --> 17:40.686
Didn't you just take Linglong Honey?

17:40.686 --> 17:42.732
How come it hurts again?

17:43.980 --> 17:46.603
How badly are you injured?

18:02.913 --> 18:04.693
Bear with it.

18:10.413 --> 18:11.660
You were hit by a Love Longing.

18:11.660 --> 18:12.980
A small fragment was left inside.

18:12.980 --> 18:14.780
I've taken it out for you.

18:14.780 --> 18:17.003
Thank you, Huo.

18:22.147 --> 18:24.147
Who exactly are you?

18:24.147 --> 18:26.513
It wasn't a coincidence
that you appeared at the inn.

18:26.513 --> 18:29.180
You've been poisoned by
the Old Souls at First Glance.

18:29.180 --> 18:31.613
You want the boy's blood to save your life.

18:31.613 --> 18:33.463
You recognize Old Souls at First Glance?

18:33.463 --> 18:35.413
I'm an old friend of the Tang Sect's heir.

18:35.413 --> 18:38.513
He's obsessed with toxicology.
I've seen his notes.

18:38.513 --> 18:40.380
This poison is usually fatal upon contact.

18:40.380 --> 18:41.980
But after being poisoned,

18:41.980 --> 18:45.247
you used inner breath to reverse Iron Shackles
to seal the opposing acupoints.

18:45.247 --> 18:48.380
Every time you reverse it,
you can survive for one more day.

18:48.380 --> 18:51.180
But a new mark appears on your back.

18:51.180 --> 18:53.513
Iron Shackles can only contain
the spread of the poison.

18:53.513 --> 18:55.413
But every time you force
the reversal of inner breath,

18:55.413 --> 18:58.413
the poison seeps deeper into you.

18:58.413 --> 19:02.576
Whenever the poison flares up,
the pain becomes unbearable.

19:04.980 --> 19:08.213
Right now, I cannot explain much.

19:08.213 --> 19:09.447
But I am not a bad person.

19:09.447 --> 19:11.613
You're not a bad person?

19:11.613 --> 19:13.313
Fine.

19:13.313 --> 19:18.213
So how do you explain the Great Compassion Palm
mark of the Shangqing Sect on your back?

19:18.213 --> 19:21.613
The Shangqing Sect is renowned
for being fair and prudent,

19:21.613 --> 19:22.913
never killing the innocent.

19:22.913 --> 19:24.947
Every time they strike,

19:24.947 --> 19:27.846
they only kill heinous scoundrels.

19:27.846 --> 19:29.780
Once struck by the Great Compassion Palm,

19:29.780 --> 19:31.546
your blood will boil,

19:31.546 --> 19:33.713
and the intense heat will cause
dark red spots to appear.

19:33.713 --> 19:35.313
Scalding to the touch.

19:35.313 --> 19:39.447
The Shangqing Sect and the Xiuluo Cult
both good and evil want you dead.

19:39.447 --> 19:42.136
Just who are you?

19:44.413 --> 19:46.643
Don't be afraid. I'm here.

19:49.913 --> 19:51.513
I'll ask you one last time.

19:51.513 --> 19:53.643
Are you going to tell me or not?

19:57.513 --> 20:00.247
If you've decided I'm a villain,

20:01.247 --> 20:02.947
then let us...

20:03.947 --> 20:05.880
part ways right here.

20:20.346 --> 20:21.963
Let's go.

22:33.860 --> 22:37.100
You must be Constable Liu's friend
from the capital.

22:37.747 --> 22:40.320
How did you know I came from the capital?

22:41.580 --> 22:42.947
[Clerk Fang, Yicheng County]
Well...

22:42.947 --> 22:44.780
I heard from Constable Liu.

22:44.780 --> 22:47.780
He had a sworn brother working in the capital.

22:47.780 --> 22:50.950
I figured it might be you.

23:04.180 --> 23:06.203
I'm sorry, I'm too late.

23:07.913 --> 23:09.913
How did Liu die?

23:12.823 --> 23:15.900
He was out on duty a few days ago.

23:15.900 --> 23:20.016
Unfortunately,
he slipped into the river and drowned.

25:28.613 --> 25:30.833
The Great Compassion Palm.

25:39.947 --> 25:42.546
[Zhi Hua, Black Fox]
The item is indeed here.

25:42.546 --> 25:44.213
Useless fools.

25:44.213 --> 25:47.136
They searched so long and found nothing.

25:50.247 --> 25:51.913
Hand it over.

26:02.813 --> 26:04.646
Trying to hide?

26:05.713 --> 26:07.646
I dare you to hide!

26:23.180 --> 26:25.013
Speak! Where is Liu Hong Yi?

26:25.013 --> 26:27.613
He's at the county office!
At the county office!

26:32.546 --> 26:35.447
[Uphold Virtue, Punish Evil]
There is no need to worry.

26:35.447 --> 26:39.713
Our master's subordinate, He Bo,
has already made his move.

26:40.713 --> 26:42.747
In this territory of Xiangzhou,

26:42.747 --> 26:44.647
is there anything he can't handle?

26:44.647 --> 26:45.980
You have no idea.

26:45.980 --> 26:50.183
Liu Hong Yi is well-known
for being stubborn and difficult.

26:50.183 --> 26:52.947
At the county office,
he doesn't even respect me.

26:52.947 --> 26:56.013
Talking back to me is just routine for him.

26:56.013 --> 26:57.313
Do you really think

26:57.313 --> 27:01.213
[County Magistrate Li, Yicheng County]
we can get any information out of that man?

27:01.213 --> 27:05.346
Whether he talks or not depends
on who interrogates him.

27:05.346 --> 27:09.947
Do you know who is interrogating
Liu Hong Yi right now?

27:09.947 --> 27:11.813
Who?

27:11.813 --> 27:17.813
Someone who will make him wish he were dead.

27:27.300 --> 27:30.120
[Liu Hong Yi, Constable of Yicheng County]

27:50.013 --> 27:52.046
The item... Did you get it?

27:52.046 --> 27:53.346
Don't worry.

28:03.140 --> 28:04.500
[Liu Yan, Five Venoms of Xiuluo Cult]

28:04.500 --> 28:05.963
[Gui Mu, Five Venoms of Xiuluo Cult]

28:07.700 --> 28:10.320
[Mei Ying, Five Venoms of Xiuluo Cult]
[Han Feng, Five Venoms of Xiuluo Cult]

28:15.113 --> 28:17.346
Once my Old Souls at First Glance hits you,

28:17.346 --> 28:19.846
you won't leave here alive.

28:20.647 --> 28:23.046
You won't make it out with me.

28:23.046 --> 28:24.113
Just leave.

28:24.913 --> 28:27.060
Take that and hurry off now!

28:28.613 --> 28:30.480
I'm not going without you.

30:57.947 --> 31:00.380
He was hit by my Old Souls at First Glance,

31:00.380 --> 31:02.613
and your Great Compassion Palm.

31:02.613 --> 31:04.900
He won't last long.

31:33.580 --> 31:36.360
You must deliver this...

31:38.147 --> 31:40.400
to the capital.

32:17.780 --> 32:21.313
A-A-Are we just leaving him?

32:22.313 --> 32:24.380
So you can talk?

32:24.380 --> 32:26.380
Have you been pretending to be mute?

32:26.380 --> 32:31.346
N-N-No, I'm not.

32:37.313 --> 32:40.346
Are you the Chang Hong Bi of Hanshui Palace?

32:40.346 --> 32:46.346
M-My name isn't Chang Hong Bi.

32:48.013 --> 32:50.060
So you could always talk.

32:52.947 --> 32:58.613
But... after drinking that... poison,

32:58.613 --> 33:03.980
I lost my voice.

33:03.980 --> 33:07.713
Just now... my throat felt itchy...

33:07.713 --> 33:12.013
and my body... was burning up.

33:12.013 --> 33:16.313
So... I cried out.

33:16.313 --> 33:18.346
So, if you don't drink that medicine,

33:18.346 --> 33:20.860
you can speak just like a normal person.

33:30.180 --> 33:31.780
You're free now.

33:31.780 --> 33:34.547
Is there anywhere you want to go?
I can take you there.

33:35.613 --> 33:39.513
We'd better find a place
far away from these chaos.

33:39.513 --> 33:41.940
I'll keep your identity a secret.

33:44.980 --> 33:46.913
You have nowhere to go?

33:46.913 --> 33:52.840
I-I-I only trust you.

33:58.813 --> 34:00.520
Let's go.

34:04.147 --> 34:07.800
He's... badly injured.

34:10.747 --> 34:12.740
So you're worried about him?

34:15.747 --> 34:18.580
At the pavilion today,

34:18.580 --> 34:22.047
he told me... to run away.

34:23.213 --> 34:26.380
You mean that after he saved you
from the Hanshui Palace disciples,

34:26.380 --> 34:28.280
he didn't drink your blood?

35:33.780 --> 35:36.920
You must be the one who intervened at the inn.

35:37.613 --> 35:38.913
You're badly injured,

35:38.913 --> 35:41.113
yet you still meddle in others' business?

35:41.113 --> 35:42.920
30 years ago...

35:43.580 --> 35:47.747
the old master of Shengyun Stronghold
died at the hands of the Tang Sect.

35:47.747 --> 35:51.413
Since then, you have been sworn enemies.

35:51.980 --> 35:53.613
Your sect is skilled with swords,

35:53.613 --> 35:55.620
but the Tang Sect excels in poisons.

35:55.620 --> 35:57.780
You've clashed many times,

35:57.780 --> 36:00.547
but you never gained the upper hand.

36:01.547 --> 36:02.647
That's why...

36:03.647 --> 36:06.346
upon hearing of Hanshui Palace's treasure,

36:06.346 --> 36:09.460
you'd seize it at any cost.

36:11.380 --> 36:14.946
Your Shengyun Stronghold has lost two masters.

36:15.846 --> 36:19.080
Master Jiao, stop being so stubborn.

36:28.703 --> 36:30.380
Didn't you say I'm good at martial arts?

36:30.380 --> 36:31.716
Then I'll hold them off for a while.

36:31.716 --> 36:34.460
Let's see if your words are genuine.

36:35.460 --> 36:37.500
You got here fast, Master Jiao.

36:37.500 --> 36:39.946
So you're willing to risk
offending Linglong Manor

36:39.946 --> 36:44.846
and Hanshui Palace
just to seize the Chang Hong Bi.

36:44.846 --> 36:49.900
Indeed, I should show Hanshui Palace
some respect.

36:49.900 --> 36:51.713
But as for Linglong Manor,

36:51.713 --> 36:54.047
I don't care about them at all!

37:23.580 --> 37:24.813
The bronze sword?

37:24.813 --> 37:28.013
Yin Yang An can defeat all weapons.

37:28.013 --> 37:32.780
Because when it was forged,
lodestones were added.

37:32.780 --> 37:37.980
So, against bronze weapons,
it's just an ordinary sword.

37:37.980 --> 37:40.946
How did you know the secret of Yin Yang An?

37:40.946 --> 37:45.203
I know plenty more secrets
about your family's martial arts!

38:34.340 --> 38:36.020
Even if you lay down your life,

38:36.020 --> 38:37.613
you can't protect this child!

38:37.613 --> 38:39.946
After I'm done with him,

38:39.946 --> 38:42.113
I'll deal with you!

39:20.340 --> 39:23.122
Save him! Go save him!

39:42.813 --> 39:45.400
So you've even studied A Fleeting Glimpse?

39:46.913 --> 39:48.413
I'm the one they want.

39:48.413 --> 39:50.220
You two should go!

39:53.846 --> 39:55.940
I won't leave you behind.

40:00.820 --> 40:02.780
Today, I shall fight to the death,

40:02.780 --> 40:05.780
and never leave this scourge to Linglong Manor!

40:38.780 --> 40:41.513
What? Haven't you had enough?

40:41.513 --> 40:43.020
I'll tell you the truth.

40:43.020 --> 40:47.180
This sword formation was created
specifically for your family.

40:47.180 --> 40:49.160
You can't break it.

40:50.247 --> 40:52.247
What are you waiting for?

40:52.247 --> 40:54.300
Go save him!

41:56.060 --> 42:00.547
Who told you about the secret
of Yin Yang An and A Fleeting Glimpse?

42:00.547 --> 42:02.913
And where did you get this sword formation?

42:02.913 --> 42:05.113
We have no grudge against Shengyun Stronghold.

42:05.113 --> 42:07.547
Why did you go to such lengths to target us?

42:08.846 --> 42:12.860
If you want to know, go ask Huo Tian Xing.

42:12.860 --> 42:17.613
However, if you let me go today,
I will not be grateful!

42:17.613 --> 42:21.313
You will surely regret it one day!

42:21.313 --> 42:24.213
The sword formation you spent years on
was broken by me in an instant.

42:24.213 --> 42:25.700
What else do I have to fear?

42:26.813 --> 42:28.813
Even if you go study ten more formations,

42:28.813 --> 42:30.520
you're still no threat to me.

42:34.780 --> 42:36.100
Wait a moment.

42:36.960 --> 42:38.402
What?

42:38.402 --> 42:40.319
Regretting it already?

42:40.913 --> 42:42.513
Have your disciples double up.

42:42.513 --> 42:44.360
Leave two horses for us.
